        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion AL-B3, Contemporary Taos Leverset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Taos Lever with Rectangular Rose is from Fusion's At Home Collection with an easy, contemporary style perfect for modern homes. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Contemporary Taos Leverset will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion AL Taos Lever with B3 Rectangular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>”Positive Stop” lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Modern Taos Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Taos Lever with Rectangular Rose, Fusion AL-B3",
                "description": "Fusion AL-B3, Taos Lever with Rectangular Rose - The Taos Lever with Rectangular Rose is from Fusion's At Home Collection with an easy, contemporary style perfect for modern homes. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Contemporary Taos Leverset will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.",
